=2 Walkthrough
* After speaking with {n:Emhi Tchaoryo}, proceed to the Beastman Ensign at the borderline of H-8/I-8 in {z:Fort Karugo-Narugo (S)} to enter {z:Ghoyu's Reverie}.

* Enter the BCNM and defeat at least 9 of the 15 Yagudos.

* The battle is capped at 30 minutes, although you will hardly need all of it.

* After defeating the Yagudos, exit the BCNM via the Twilight Aureole.

* Only the party leader need have the Ops orders to enter the BCNM. Anyone from any nation can assist. Everyone will receive {p:Experience Points} upon completion of the BCNM. Those signed up for this {p:Campaign Ops} will receive {p:Allied Notes} upon speaking to {n:Emhi Tchaoryo}.

